   "tips": [
    {
     "kind": "general",
     "text": "Headhunting is the Skullsplitter camp on the second circuit. Leave Bloodscalp Clan Heads and Speaking with Nezzliok for the 40+ file. They need 582 and are level 40 and 41.",
